{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19986","headline":"题韦少保静恭宅藏书洞 · 孟郊","name":"题韦少保静恭宅藏书洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高意合天制，自然状无穷。\n仙华凝四时，玉藓生数峰。\n书秘漆文字，匣藏金蛟龙。\n闲爲气候肃，开作云雨浓。\n洞隐谅非久，岩梦诚必通。\n将缀文士集，贯就真珠丛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}